  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1480",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-16T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T11:05:40.292Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायुको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the partial influence of westerly winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा तथा कर्णाली प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ तथा बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ । कोशी तथा गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Koshi, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, as well as in the Himalayan region of Karnali Province. The weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas. Mist/fog is likely at a few places in the Terai regions, valleys and river basins during the early morning. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी प्रदेश लगायत बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ तथा बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग तथा गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Koshi Province and the Himalayan region of Gandaki Province.",
    "special": ""
  },
